rate boundaries and an original fees-versus-stipend offer comparison.\",\"image\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/images/day15/study-desk-1280.webp\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-11-19\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-11-23\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass Editorial Team\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/editorial-policy/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/logo.svg\"}},\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/australia-research-training-program/\"}"}}],["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do I apply to the Department of Education?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. Contact the chosen eligible provider; universities run the student application and selection process.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does every RTP award pay the maximum stipend?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. Read the actual offer. The government table gives applicable stipend boundaries, while universities determine awards under the rules.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can a tuition offset pay my living costs?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"It offsets the relevant tuition liability. Record a living stipend and ancillary allowances separately rather than counting fee relief as available cash.\"}}]}"}}]],["$","section",null,{"className":"inner-hero inner-hero--compact inner-hero--guide inner-hero--visual","children":"$L1a"}],false,"$L1b","$L1c"]}]
