1d:["$","p","Save the exact degree, provider and intake before looking for a funding deadline. Then find the provider’s research admission and RTP scholarship instructions. They determine selection processes and timing. A central government explanation does not establish that every university has an open international award round, or that admission and scholarship assessment happen automatically through one identical process.",{"children":"Save the exact degree, provider and intake before looking for a funding deadline. Then find the provider’s research admission and RTP scholarship instructions. They determine selection processes and timing. A central government explanation does not establish that every university has an open international award round, or that admission and scholarship assessment happen automatically through one identical process."}]
