24:["$","h2",null,{"children":"Read the 2027 rate bounds without assuming the maximum"}]
25:["$","p","The government’s published full-time annual RTP stipend table gives a 2027 base of A$35,550 and a maximum of A$55,537. The 2026 figures are A$34,315 and A$53,608. These are year-specific boundaries for RTP stipends, not a promise that an applicant will receive the maximum or that every award has identical ancillary benefits.",{"children":"The government’s published full-time annual RTP stipend table gives a 2027 base of A$35,550 and a maximum of A$55,537. The 2026 figures are A$34,315 and A$53,608. These are year-specific boundaries for RTP stipends, not a promise that an applicant will receive the maximum or that every award has identical ancillary benefits."}]
26:["$","p","The provider decides the actual award within the applicable rules and competitive selection process. Keep its stated annual amount, commencement date and payment arrangements with your offer. Dividing an annual figure by twelve is only a budgeting average unless the offer confirms that payment pattern. Do not call the difference between government base and maximum a guaranteed bonus available on request.",{"children":"The provider decides the actual award within the applicable rules and competitive selection process. Keep its stated annual amount, commencement date and payment arrangements with your offer. Dividing an annual figure by twelve is only a budgeting average unless the offer confirms that payment pattern. Do not call the difference between government base and maximum a guaranteed bonus available on request."}]
27:[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Published full-time annual RTP rate bounds","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Published full-time annual RTP rate bounds"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Year",{"scope":"col","children":"Year"}],["$","th","Base",{"scope":"col","children":"Base"}],["$","th","Maximum",{"scope":"col","children":"Maximum"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"2027"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"A$35,550"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"A$55,537"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"2026"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"A$34,315"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"A$53,608"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Your offer"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Read its actual rate"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Not automatically the maximum"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"]
28:["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://www.education.gov.au/research-block-grants/research-training-program",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.education.gov.au/research-block-grants/research-training-program","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Australian Government: RTP structure and stipend-rate table"}]]}]]]}]
29:["$","section","3-Build an original uncovered-cost calculation",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Build an original uncovered-cost calculation"}],[["$","p","Use a fictional annual living budget of A$39,600 and, solely for the exercise, a confirmed stipend equal to the published 2027 base of A$35,550. The living-only difference is A$4,050 for the year. If you also assume A$2,000 of arrival costs outside the written support, the first-year gap becomes A$6,050. Replace both cost assumptions and the stipend with your actual evidence.",{"children":"Use a fictional annual living budget of A$39,600 and, solely for the exercise, a confirmed stipend equal to the published 2027 base of A$35,550. The living-only difference is A$4,050 for the year. If you also assume A$2,000 of arrival costs outside the written support, the first-year gap becomes A$6,050. Replace both cost assumptions and the stipend with your actual evidence."}],["$","p","A tuition offset must not be added to the cash available for rent. Keep tuition treatment on its own line and record any covered allowance without double counting it. Also distinguish a refundable deposit from spending: it can raise the money needed at arrival even though some may return later. A positive annual balance does not guarantee sufficient cash before the first payment.",{"children":"A tuition offset must not be added to the cash available for rent. Keep tuition treatment on its own line and record any covered allowance without double counting it. Also distinguish a refundable deposit from spending: it can raise the money needed at arrival even though some may return later. A positive annual balance does not guarantee sufficient cash before the first payment."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Original first-year gap exercise: costs assumed","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Original first-year gap exercise: costs assumed"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Line",{"scope":"col","children":"Line"}],["$","th","Calculation",{"scope":"col","children":"Calculation"}],["$","th","Result",{"scope":"col","children":"Result"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Living only"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"39,600 −35,550"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"A$4,050 gap"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Additional arrival costs"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Assumed 2,000 outside support"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Check actual coverage"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"First-year cash shortfall"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"4,050 +2,000"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"A$6,050"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","3",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Tuition offset"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Separate fee treatment"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Not rent money"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
2a:["$","section","4-Compare scholarship duration with candidature",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Compare scholarship duration with candidature"}],[["$","p","The government describes full-time research-doctorate RTP support of three to four years at the provider’s discretion, and research-master’s support of up to two years. The university’s actual support period is necessary for planning. Do not substitute the maximum theoretical duration for the duration in your award or assume every permitted candidature extension extends the stipend.",{"children":"The government describes full-time research-doctorate RTP support of three to four years at the provider’s discretion, and research-master’s support of up to two years. The university’s actual support period is necessary for planning. Do not substitute the maximum theoretical duration for the duration in your award or assume every permitted candidature extension extends the stipend."}],["$","p","Write a month-by-month coverage row from commencement to the intended completion date. Mark an unfunded tail if the award ends earlier, and ask how approved interruptions, leave or prior candidature affect support under the applicable policy. The student FAQ explains that time already spent in the research degree can matter to the maximum period. Your research office can assess the actual record; this guide cannot reset it to zero.",{"children":"Write a month-by-month coverage row from commencement to the intended completion date. Mark an unfunded tail if the award ends earlier, and ask how approved interruptions, leave or prior candidature affect support under the applicable policy. The student FAQ explains that time already spent in the research degree can matter to the maximum period. Your research office can assess the actual record; this guide cannot reset it to zero."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://www.education.gov.au/research-block-grants/research-training-program/research-training-program-frequently-asked-questions-students",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.education.gov.au/research-block-grants/research-training-program/research-training-program-frequently-asked-questions-students","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Australian Government: RTP student questions"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}]
2b:["$","section","5-Treat international eligibility and selection as different questions",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Treat international eligibility and selection as different questions"}],[["$","p","The student FAQ permits eligible domestic and international research-degree students, while universities apply competitive selection criteria and control available awards. A candidate can satisfy the general programme eligibility conditions without winning a particular university’s international stipend allocation. Ask the research office about the actual round rather than inferring funding from an admission offer.",{"children":"The student FAQ permits eligible domestic and international research-degree students, while universities apply competitive selection criteria and control available awards. A candidate can satisfy the general programme eligibility conditions without winning a particular university’s international stipend allocation. Ask the research office about the actual round rather than inferring funding from an admission offer."}],["$","p","Prepare an original evidence map linking the proposed research question, relevant preparation, supervisory environment and requested documents. Mark uncertainties honestly, including whether a supervisor endorsement, admission application or separate scholarship form is required. The government’s general RTP description does not supply universal IELTS scores or permission to skip a university requirement. Check those details with the chosen provider before paying for tests or submitting.",{"children":"Prepare an original evidence map linking the proposed research question, relevant preparation, supervisory environment and requested documents. Mark uncertainties honestly, including whether a supervisor endorsement, admission application or separate scholarship form is required. The government’s general RTP description does not supply universal IELTS scores or permission to skip a university requirement. Check those details with the chosen provider before paying for tests or submitting."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://www.education.gov.au/research-block-grants/research-training-program/research-training-program-frequently-asked-questions-students",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.education.gov.au/research-block-grants/research-training-program/research-training-program-frequently-asked-questions-students","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Australian Government: RTP student questions"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}]
2c:["$","section","6-Check the offer before accepting or budgeting against it",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-7","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Check the offer before accepting or budgeting against it"}],[["$","p","Create a final offer ledger with tuition treatment, stipend amount, support period, ancillary allowances, payment prerequisites and continuation conditions. Add the university’s rules for paid work or outside activities where relevant. Do not infer an unrestricted work entitlement from the existence of a stipend; provider policies and other applicable conditions need separate checking.",{"children":"Create a final offer ledger with tuition treatment, stipend amount, support period, ancillary allowances, payment prerequisites and continuation conditions. Add the university’s rules for paid work or outside activities where relevant. Do not infer an unrestricted work entitlement from the existence of a stipend; provider policies and other applicable conditions need separate checking."}],["$","p","In a fictional final audit, admission is confirmed but the stipend outcome is still pending. The student keeps the budget’s stipend line at zero in the confirmed-funding case and compares a separate possible-award case. That preserves the real decision: whether the plan is affordable before a funding result. Retain the university’s written offer and ask about any unclear component rather than treating a government rate table as your award letter.",{"children":"In a fictional final audit, admission is confirmed but the stipend outcome is still pending. The student keeps the budget’s stipend line at zero in the confirmed-funding case and compares a separate possible-award case. That preserves the real decision: whether the plan is affordable before a funding result. Retain the university’s written offer and ask about any unclear component rather than treating a government rate table as your award letter."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Original offer ledger","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Original offer ledger"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Component",{"scope":"col","children":"Component"}],["$","th","Confirmed value and period",{"scope":"col","children":"Confirmed value and period"}],["$","th","Status",{"scope":"col","children":"Status"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Admission"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Exact degree/intake"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Offer or pending"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Tuition"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Offset/liability in writing"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Confirmed or unresolved"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Stipend"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Actual annual rate and duration"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Awarded or pending"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","3",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Arrival and other costs"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Coverage/exclusions stated"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Personal cash required"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
2d:["$","section","7-Your next useful research-funding task",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Your next useful research-funding task"}],[["$","p","Choose one eligible provider and a research programme that fits your academic work. Save its current admission and scholarship pages, then fill the provider-first record and component ledger above. If the round is closed, prepare the research evidence without announcing a new national opening date. Repeat the comparison only for another plausible programme rather than collecting unrelated deadlines.",{"children":"Choose one eligible provider and a research programme that fits your academic work. Save its current admission and scholarship pages, then fill the provider-first record and component ledger above. If the round is closed, prepare the research evidence without announcing a new national opening date. Repeat the comparison only for another plausible programme rather than collecting unrelated deadlines."}],["$","p","This guide uses government documents for programme boundaries and original fictional examples for planning. It has not tested an authenticated university application portal, reviewed your eligibility or confirmed a visa outcome. The useful result is a clearer set of questions and a cost calculation that can be replaced with real offer evidence.",{"children":"This guide uses government documents for programme boundaries and original fictional examples for planning. It has not tested an authenticated university application portal, reviewed your eligibility or confirmed a visa outcome. The useful result is a clearer set of questions and a cost calculation that can be replaced with real offer evidence."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Your next useful research-funding task","children":[["$","$L5","/guides/statement-of-purpose/",{"href":"/guides/statement-of-purpose/","children":["Plan a focused research proposal",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L5","/countries/australia/",{"href":"/countries/australia/","children":["Compare Australia scholarship routes",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
2e:["$","section","8-Continue with a specific application task",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-9","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Continue with a specific application task"}],[["$","p","Check the next decision with a focused programme, document or calculation guide.",{"children":"Check the next decision with a focused programme, document or calculation guide."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Continue with a specific application task","children":[["$","$L5","/scholarships/monash-graduate-scholarship/",{"href":"/scholarships/monash-graduate-scholarship/","children":["Monash Graduate Scholarship: stipend, tuition and the 2027 round",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
